  <NOTES 0 0
  |ICST HOA Reaper Session Starter v3
  |
  |This version is optimized as a guided session starter.
  |
  |Use this order
  |1. Check Project Settings and audio device.
  |2. Load one source onto SRC 01.
  |3. Insert ICST MonoEncoder on the source track.
  |4. Route encoded signal to HOA BUS.
  |5. Insert ICST Decoder on DECODER MAIN.
  |6. Load the loudspeaker preset for your setup.
  |7. Optionally mirror HOA BUS to BINAURAL CHECK.
  |8. Run a short movement and speaker test.
  |
  |Suggested routing
  |SRC tracks -> HOA BUS -> DECODER MAIN
  |SRC tracks -> HOA BUS -> BINAURAL CHECK
  |
  |Track naming convention
  |- [INSERT] means plugin should be inserted here
  |- [ROUTE] means this track is part of the bus structure
  |- [CHECK] means monitoring or verification
  >
